{
    "title": "Audio Master - Ringtone Maker",
    "description": "Audio Master can help you conveniently edit the audio files in your phone, whether it is audio combination or audio capture, and it is very simple to make a phone ringtone.\r\n\r\nFunction introduction:\r\n1. Import audio files in the phone with one click;\r\n2. One-click extraction of audio files in video;\r\n3. Support the conversion of audio files to other formats;\r\n4. Support editing and renaming audio files;\r\n5. When editing audio files, multiple audio files can be added for multi-track editing, and the priority of each track can be adjusted;\r\n6. You can easily drag to change the length of the audio file and the position of the timeline where the audio is located;\r\n7. Two track alignment modes are supported;\r\n8. All projects can be saved automatically for you to modify again.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Audio Master can help you conveniently edit the audio files in your phone, whether it is audio combination or audio capture, and it is very simple to make a phone ringtone.<br><br>Function introduction:<br>1. Import audio files in the phone with one click;<br>2. One-click extraction of audio files in video;<br>3. Support the conversion of audio files to other formats;<br>4. Support editing and renaming audio files;<br>5. When editing audio files, multiple audio files can be added for multi-track editing, and the priority of each track can be adjusted;<br>6. You can easily drag to change the length of the audio file and the position of the timeline where the audio is located;<br>7. Two track alignment modes are supported;<br>8. All projects can be saved automatically for you to modify again.",
